WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.329 --> 00:00:05.589
We all may be at home
But we haven’t let that shutdown our lives

00:00:05.589 --> 00:00:13.519
Like Dr. Neha who’s safety tips are trending
Mr. Kishore who’s started a mobile grocery

00:00:13.519 --> 00:00:17.050
delivery service
Simmy who’s started digital yoga classes

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:27.460
And Vicky who’s made his team meetings virtual
When you have not stopped living life

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:28.900
Then why would you stop investing?

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:35.340
Awaken the smart investor in you
Don’t worry about the market ups and downs

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:40.381
And start a systematic investment plan (SIP)
So India, while you sit at home, Invest Smart

00:00:40.381 --> 00:00:45.150
&amp; start a SIP
Mutual Fund investments are subject to market

00:00:45.150 --> 00:00:47.750
risks, read all scheme related documents carefully

